# Chocobo on the Loose! (jeuno 92): a level 20 Warrior with ENABLE_TOAU true: the Lua's `== 1` is false for a boolean
# (Settings.MainEquals, quest rework P9; MainNumber / Main would read true as 1): no section, Brutus's default 66. Then 1:
# 10093, begun. Brutus's other quests are kept silent as in #available (Chocobo's Wounds and Save My Son completed by a GM
# before login). Recorded on Lua at 49c07d3a^ (the parent of the commit that deleted the Lua).
lists UpperJeuno/Brutus/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/10093
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 job=WAR lvl=20
quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
setting ENABLE_TOAU true
login
trigger Brutus                          # ENABLE_TOAU true: no section; the default 66
finish
setting ENABLE_TOAU 1
trigger Brutus                          # 10093
finish                                  # begun
